<title>UK: Bridon says in bid talks with FKI.</title>
<headline>Bridon says in bid talks with FKI.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>British wire rope and lifting systems manufacturer Bridon Plc said on Monday it was in talks with engineering group FKI Plc on a possible offer for Bridon.</p>
<p>Bridon said more information would be sent to shareholders &quot;in due course&quot; but gave no further details.</p>
<p>Bridon shares jumped 23p to 129 by 0725 GMT.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 4017</p>
</text>
